version. ODC-By governs database rights and does not warrant the contents or
clear every independent right in individual contents.

Optional port context distributed under public/ports is derived from Natural
Earth Ports:
https://github.com/nvkelso/natural-earth-vector

Natural Earth data is in the public domain:
https://www.naturalearthdata.com/about/terms-of-use/

The projected port points are generalized and incomplete. Some source
locations may be approximate by up to 20 miles and are not operational harbour
information.

Optional airport context distributed under public/airports is derived from
OurAirports:
https://ourairports.com/data/

OurAirports releases its data to the Public Domain and requests, but does not
require, credit. It provides no guarantee of accuracy or fitness for use. The
projected airport points are static reference context and are not navigation or
operational flight information.
